<![CDATA[<div>The Payment Run is Completed<br><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">Please find the details:</font></div><div style=""><ul style=""><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Payment Run Number: {!Core_MDF_Payment_Run__c.Name}</font></li><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Geo: {!Core_MDF_Payment_Run__c.Core_MDF_Geo_Txt__c}</font></li><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Status: {!Core_MDF_Payment_Run__c.Core_MDF_Status_Txt__c}</font></li><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Program: {!Core_MDF_Payment_Run__c.Core_MDF_Program_Id__c}</font></li></ul></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font style="" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">Please Click <a href="{!Core_MDF_Payment_Run__c.Link}" style="">here</a> to view the Payment Run Record.</font></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
